		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="29915"></a><b>Hey folks</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Guest<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=29915&amp;sid=37634cf649f2b0883893e794f03e86bf#29915"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Tue Jul 13, 2004 4:01 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: 65 shaman application</span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=29915&amp;sid=37634cf649f2b0883893e794f03e86bf"><img src="templates/subBlack/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Quite a few of you know my toon since i am a real life friend of Tjubang and Lenthern as well. I stopped playing EQ back in september '03, i was bored with raids and i hated the Ldon expansion and still do. A month ago or so i reinstalled the game and been playing since then.....well not quite the truth, been online some but not really playing. 
<br />
EQ with no guildchat and no guildmates to get groups with is no more than an advanced chat program. I was told by several people that DR does not need more shamans but i have to try so here it is <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="Smile" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
My toon is a shaman and the name is Janin Tehslack, surname taken on Tjubangs suggestion and altogether untrue!
<br />

<br />
 Magelo: <a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=224333" target="_blank">http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=224333</a> 
<br />

<br />
My last guild was Mortalis and when i quit we were well into raiding Ldon content (YAWN!), had killed Quarm several times and he also dropped my breastplate. That is as far as my experience goes, i have killed every single mob in the game up untill then.....except for the new Bristlebane i guess.
<br />
My aa's, flags and keys can be seen on my magelo but i have them all except for any GoD flags.
<br />
Besides that, i have been playing EQ together with Tjubang since late april '99, started on Mithaniel Marr server where i got my ORIGINAL Guise of the deceiver. My guild back then was competing with Afterlife, or rather was owned by Afterlife so when the serversplit was announced we went to the Drinal server.
<br />
Eventually i created my own guild there (Winter's Light) with a few friends and we quickly grew to be on par with the traditionally best guild there, Cats in Hats. I got some experience as raidleader and officer in that short time before the split to AB.
<br />
American playtimes never suited me and even though i had collected many european players in WL we raided very late so when Antonius Bayle got online i went there together with quite a few members from WL. We all ended up in Mortalis by an agreement i had made with the guildleader back then.
<br />

<br />
Why am i applying for DR? Because i would like to be in the same guild as Tjubang. I have always been higher level than he, always had too good gear to make grouping worthwhile. However, not anymore, he is close to me now both in gear and aa's.
<br />
Secondly i have gotten to know a few nice players in DR and they really seem to like their guild and from what i hear on the server DR is well liked all around.
<br />
Third....hmmmm phat lewt?!?!?
<br />

<br />
My computer is a brandnew 2.8 P4 with 512 ram and 64 MB graphics and my internet connection is 128/512 ADSL and is very stable.
<br />
My real life name is Jesper, I am 27 years old and i come from Denmark. I like romantic candlelight dinners and long walks in the forest but i also like to party and get pissed. I work with kids in a daycare institution for the moment, however i will be attending school from october to become a cook.
<br />
My playtimes depends on work/school and as it is now i work 37 hours/week and when i get off from work i can go home and play, so basically everyday except for the occasional going out/seeing friends/late night meetings and stuff.
<br />

<br />
Also, you can find me on msn by email: <a href="mailto:Skibsted1976@hotmail.com">Skibsted1976@hotmail.com</a>, if i have forgotten something send me an email, tell or something else <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="Smile" border="0" />
<br />

<br />

<br />
Regards, Janin/Jesper</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
